    "result_text": "`AcceptanceTest` is the only test class with `@Test` methods, and the full `mvn test` reports **BUILD SUCCESS** with all tests green.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `ownerSegment` field on the owner resource, following the repository's existing Spring conventions for derived read-only fields.\n\n**Changes:**\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added the `ownerSegment` read-only property to the `Owner` schema (the DTO is generated from this spec at build time), typed as an enum of the four allowed values `PREMIUM_METRO`, `PREMIUM_REGIONAL`, `STANDARD_METRO`, `STANDARD_REGIONAL`, with a description matching the spec.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a `@Mapping` for `ownerSegment` and a `formatOwnerSegment` helper. It reuses the existing derivation helpers so the segment always agrees with the other reported fields:\n   - **TIER** = `PREMIUM` when `formatMembershipLevel(owner) >= 3`, else `STANDARD`.\n   - **AREA** = `METRO` when `formatLocality(owner)` is a known region (checked against the existing `REGION_TIMEZONE` keys = NSW/VIC/QLD), else `REGIONAL`.\n\nBoth new acceptance tests (`coreSegmentForKnownRegion` \u2192 `STANDARD_METRO`, `functionalitySegmentForUnknownRegion` \u2192 `STANDARD_REGIONAL`) pass, and the full suite is green.",
